<title>USA: Florida approves $189.84 mln education bonds.</title>
<headline>Florida approves $189.84 mln education bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TALLAHASSEE, Fla 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Florida officials approved a $189.84 million Board of Education bond issue Tuesday, the Division of Bond Finance said.</p>
<p>The issue, State Board of Education Capital Outlay Bonds 1997 Series A, are to be sold by competitive bid at a date to be announced later.</p>
<p>The issue was approved by the Florida Cabinet, made up of the governor, treasurer and other executive branch leaders.</p>
<p>--Jane Sutton, 305-374-5013</p>
